@startuml
title Activity - UC-10 Private Achievements [PROPOSED / NOT IMPLEMENTED]
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Receive qualifying learning event;
:Load active badge rules;
while (Rule remains?) is (yes)
  :Evaluate learner-owned progress;
  if (Condition met?) then (yes)
    if (Badge already awarded?) then (yes)
      :No-op (idempotent);
    else (no)
      :Award private badge;
    endif
  endif
endwhile (no)
:Show learner-owned badge collection;
note right
  No leaderboard or social feed.
  Data model and award mechanism are proposed.
end note
stop
@enduml
